## Summary

Turn the broad environment-and-space portion of the JBI Supporting Information outline into a manuscript-ready Appendix S3 grounded in the current checksum-locked reconstruction and active predictive code.

## Appendix content

- separates the observation-level INLA-SPDE models used for environmental coefficients/spatial ranges from the cell-level cross-fitted natural reference used by Main 3;
- records the full 1,922-observation / 1,305-cell analysis boundary;
- documents the response-blind climate, terrain and soil PCA rotations and the structural East/West adjustment;
- gives mesh settings and Matérn PC priors exactly as implemented;
- provides complete active environment-plus-space coefficient tables for pigmentation state and pigmented-only intensity;
- reports spatial range/SD estimates and their inference ceiling;
- documents the 50-km broad/within environmental basis, five blocked folds, 1,000 predictive draws and calibration/performance metrics;
- states explicitly that AUC is not variance partitioning and the SPDE field is unresolved geography rather than one historical mechanism.

## Exclusions

The Appendix does not revive the old national Bombus increment models, all-five limitation gates, legacy variance-partition narrative or any causal environmental claim.

## Repository integration

- registers Appendix S3 in the active paper map and submission README;
- updates the SI architecture with completed content and remaining figure exports;
- extends the JBI validator to require titled, anonymity-safe Appendices S1-S3.

## Scientific effect

No analysis, model, coefficient, predictive draw, frozen artifact, manuscript result or claim ceiling is changed. The PR exposes existing current evidence in submission form.

## Numerical basis

Current frozen Main 1/Main 3 reference: workflow `31258851297`, artifact `9022276431`, SHA-256 `0135939a9c66d087ea2fc8e2e00a6e4802927a63b400c2011d63e5b86e004240`. The running clean re-execution is not promoted here until its artifact is independently compared with this lock.

## Validation

`Current paper checks`, R parsing/tests and the JBI package validator must pass before merge.
